  "criticalEvidence": [
    "VirtualItem_Commander4493 AddItem34315/AddItemOnlyModel34313 invoke virtual Use slot7 unchanged long count. Use34314 ignores quantity, current CommanderControl.Manager.UnlockCommander(config.paramInt), then current UIControl.CommanderUI.RefreshCommanderItem(config.paramInt), reads config param again after resolving UI. No base item stock mutation/report.",
    "CommanderManager31013 GetCommanderData uses TryGetValue and returns null on miss.31015 UnlockCommander unconditionally writes CommanderData4030.curLevel(offset16)=1; existing higher level is reset, missing row throws. Added these real methods to existing manager; no invented unlock price or protection.",
    "VirtualItem_HeadBox4497 Add34323/OnlyModel34325 likewise virtual Use34324 ignoring quantity, current UserInfoControl.UnlockHeadBox(config.paramInt).32198 checks HaveHeadBox then AddHeadBox. Manager32228 reads actual UserInfoData.field52 List<int>.Contains;32229 List.Add then UserInfo_HeadBoxUnlock(id). Control guard skips duplicates; direct manager Add permits duplicates. OutgameHeadBoxInventory restores these methods against explicit current owner-list provider; full UserInfoManager/control lifecycle not claimed.",
    "VirtualItem_HeroPiece4498 Add34327/OnlyModel34326/Use34329 call original virtual/base behavior; no extra crafting, consume or unlock. Shared WASM labels ActivityVirtualItemBase are aliases; type metadata establishes actual parent VirtualItemBase4492.",
    "VirtualItem_Strength4499 Add34330 invokes base Add then sends Event.SP_CHANGE with null args; Use34331 invokes base Use then same event. Inherited AddItemOnlyModel does not send SP. Source Event4271 field56 and cctor32607 SP_CHANGE confirmed. Failure before notification skips it without reverting prior base effects.",
    "VirtualItem_GamePoints4495 Add34318 and OnlyModel34319 execute respective base first then current DiceGameControl.AddPoint(low32 count). DiceGameControl31102 discards caller quantity and invokes DiceGameDataManager.ChangePoint with zeros.31135 ChangePoint ignores receiver/delta, gets31144 GetPoint = low32 current GlobalItemManager.GetItemCount(11001), clamps returned/message value to max(value,0), sends Mxtz_DataChange(1,result), returns result. It never adds count or repairs global stock. Restored narrow OutgameDicePoints service, not full4038 lifecycle.",
    "Factory service now constructs all seven supported virtual source types. Only PackageOpenAuto4490 and PackageOpenManual4491 remain explicit AdditionalConstructors. Original unsupported type2=6/7/9 remain null rather than invented entities.13 new checks load actual79-row shared item table and exercise concrete constructor/real reward engine and real CommanderManager, while UI refresh/reporting and profile ownership remain explicit service boundaries."
  ],
